 "citation": "Local Government Directory (LGD), Ministry of Panchayati Raj, Government of India; yashveeeeeeer/india-geodata; bharatlas (the LGD layers as served, read for this crosswalk). Census 2011 <-> LGD crosswalk, as released by bharatlas: bharatlas-cw-2026.11 (sha256:e786c0a11ef62b233dfde2f2fd3e0053ab11c86908b0976a4699f9d448db106f). https://bharatlas.com/releases/bharatlas-cw-2026.11/",
